    "n1": { "x": 0, "y": 2340, "w": 380, "fill": "blue", "text": "What needs attention comes first and is ordered by urgency. The ladder of a chase opens in place; the live counts stay fixed on the right." },
    "n2": { "x": 0, "y": 3740, "w": 380, "fill": "teal", "text": "Adding a service is one screen that changes shape across four steps. The summary of what has been entered pins on the left, so nothing is lost and nothing is retyped." },
    "n3": { "x": 0, "y": 5140, "w": 380, "fill": "orange", "text": "Suspending is a three-state screen: ask why, say what happened, then ask two things before resuming. The destructive step always names what will happen first." },
    "n4": { "x": 0, "y": 7940, "w": 380, "fill": "purple", "text": "The two-person pattern: the owner sends, a second person approves or sends back. The diff is the main thing on the approver's screen." }
